    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Book of the Damned pg. 178",
    "definition_raw": "Source Book of the Damned pg. 178\nYou wield spiked chains with effortless lethality.\n\nPrerequisites: Dex 15, Exotic Weapon Proficiency (spiked chain).\n\nBenefit: You treat a spiked chain as a one-handed martial weapon for all purposes. You can still choose to wield a spiked chain as a two-handed weapon, and if you do so, you gain a +2 bonus on combat maneuver checks to disarm or trip foes with your spiked chain.",
